{"indicator":"main-share","unit":"%","years":[2010,2020],"notes":{"TWN":"Pew 把台灣的民間信仰與道教歸在「其他宗教」（2020 年約 52%），佛教徒約 19%、無宗教信仰約 23%、基督徒約 6%。很多人同時拜佛、拜神、祭祖，用單一宗教分類只是近似。內政部宗教統計：2025 年底登記的寺廟 12,397 座（道教 9,824、佛教 2,277、一貫道 243），教會（堂）2,855 座（基督教 2,373、天主教 429）；民間信仰多半沒有登記入教，內政部沒有各宗教的信徒比例。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Pew counts Taiwan's folk religion and Taoism as \"other religions\" (about 52% in 2020); about 19% are Buddhist, 23% unaffiliated and 6% Christian. Many people worship at Buddhist and folk temples and venerate ancestors at the same time, so a single religion is only an approximation. Ministry of the Interior religious statistics: at the end of 2025 there were 12,397 registered temples (Taoist 9,824, Buddhist 2,277, Yiguandao 243) and 2,855 churches (Protestant 2,373, Catholic 429); most folk-religion believers are not registered, so the ministry has no figures on the share of believers."},"encoding":"delta","values":{"AFG":[-1,997,2],"ALB":[-1,702,43],"DZA":[-1,986,-2],"AGO":[-1,916,14],"ARG":[-1,881,4],"ARM":[-1,975,-2],"ABW":[-1,822,-8],"AUS":[-1,671,-203],"AUT":[-1,804,-122],"AZE":[-1,971,-24],"BHS":[-1,975,1],"BHR":[-1,702,38],"BGD":[-1,904,7],"BRB":[-1,766,7],"BLR":[-1,938,-87],"BEL":[-1,611,-101],"BLZ":[-1,740,4],"BEN":[-1,583,-51],"BTN":[-1,747,0],"BOL":[-1,957,-68],"BIH":[-1,513,23],"BWA":[-1,805,18],"BRA":[-1,892,-85],"BRN":[-1,788,34],"BGR":[-1,814,-19],"BFA":[-1,643,31],"BDI":[-1,954,-4],"KHM":[-1,969,2],"CMR":[-1,717,-19],"CAN":[-1,672,-139],"CPV":[-1,857,-74],"CAF":[-1,898,9],"TCD":[-1,573,-9],"CHL":[-1,860,-177],"CHN":[-1,874,22],"COL":[-1,924,-62],"COM":[-1,995,-12],"CRI":[-1,912,-33],"HRV":[-1,937,-28],"CUB":[-1,588,19],"CUW":[-1,907,-1],"CYP":[-1,655,22],"CZE":[-1,685,43],"COD":[-1,965,-2],"DNK":[-1,802,-33],"DJI":[-1,974,3],"DOM":[-1,849,-73],"ECU":[-1,956,-71],"EGY":[-1,949,3],"SLV":[-1,883,-12],"GNQ":[-1,887,0],"ERI":[-1,513,4],"EST":[-1,612,-86],"SWZ":[-1,931,1],"ETH":[-1,626,-10],"FSM":[-1,988,0],"FJI":[-1,655,40],"FIN":[-1,818,-95],"FRA":[-1,571,-1